{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261127/photo/bkn-20261127120443752-1127_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261127122304\"/><p>將軍澳發生3車相撞意外。</p><p>將軍澳發生交通意外。今日(27日)早上10時55分，一輛泥頭車、一輛私家車及一輛貨車順序沿將軍澳隧道公路行駛，至近寶康公園對開時3車首尾相撞，當中私家車車頭剷入泥頭車車尾，車尾被貨車撼撞嚴重損毀。救護車接報到場將私家車男司機及女乘客送院治理，意外原因有待調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T04:37:49.381406+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T04:04:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T15:57:24.506915+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T04:31:24.137242+00:00","content_hash":"2d14eff6ec414c8cb643488eb986efbfb83d4de82ce260612552d367030ce8de","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}